---
// Approved Living Systems composition; native Astro, no client framework.

---
<section class="ls-visual-episode ls-container">
<div class="ls-episode-copy">
<p class="ls-eyebrow">THE FREE EDITOR IS A REAL WORKSPACE</p>
<h2>WRITE. SEARCH.<br/>CHART. EXPORT.<br/>
<span class="ls-stroke">KEEP YOUR FILES.</span>
</h2>
<div class="ls-episode-dek">
<p>Editor, Reader and Source views. Two panes and tabs. Full-text and semantic search on your Mac. Editable tables, local pictures, 34 chart types and 20 diagram types, all in ordinary Markdown. Charts and diagrams render offline.</p>
</div>
<a class="ls-text-link" href="/flow/documents-and-files/">Tour the everyday tools<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" fill="none" height="17" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="17" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M5 12h14">
</path>
<path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7">
</path>
</svg>
</a>
</div>
<figure aria-label="One document. Many ways to think." class="ls-scene ls-workshop-scene" data-frame="0" data-scene="true" data-scene-count="3">
<div class="ls-scene-chrome">
<span>
<i>
</i>
<i>
</i>
<i>
</i>
</span>
<b>One document. Many ways to think.</b>
<span>FLOW / ILLUSTRATION</span>
</div>
<div class="ls-scene-body">
<div aria-label="Document views" class="ls-scene-choice">
<button aria-pressed="true" data-scene-select="0" type="button">Table</button>
<button aria-pressed="false" data-scene-select="1" type="button">Chart</button>
<button aria-pressed="false" data-scene-select="2" type="button">Diagram</button>
</div>
<div class="ls-workshop-layout">
<div class="ls-code-sheet">
<span>SOURCE / PLAIN TEXT</span>
<pre data-scene-panel="0">| Workstream | Done | Total |
| Research   |  8   |  10   |
| Launch     |  6   |   8   |
| Editorial  |  3   |   6   |</pre>
<pre data-scene-panel="1" hidden="">Workstream, Done, Total
Research,   8,    10
Launch,     6,     8
Editorial,  3,     6

View: completion by workstream</pre>
<pre data-scene-panel="2" hidden="">Sources → Definition
Definition → Table
Definition → Chart
Table + Chart → Review</pre>
<small>Illustrative data and readable definitions.</small>
</div>
<div class="ls-workshop-output">
<div data-scene-panel="0">
<span class="ls-output-label">EDIT THE CELL. KEEP THE FILE.</span>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Workstream</th>
<th>Done</th>
<th>Total</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Research</td>
<td>8</td>
<td>10</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Launch</td>
<td class="ls-cell-selected">6</td>
<td>8</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Editorial</td>
<td>3</td>
<td>6</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<small>One cell changes. Surrounding Markdown stays intact.</small>
</div>
<div data-scene-panel="1" hidden="">
<span class="ls-output-label">LET THE NUMBERS SPEAK.</span>
<div class="ls-mini-bars">
<div>
<span>Research</span>
<i style="width:80%">
</i>
<b>80%</b>
</div>
<div>
<span>Launch</span>
<i style="width:75%">
</i>
<b>75%</b>
</div>
<div>
<span>Editorial</span>
<i style="width:50%">
</i>
<b>50%</b>
</div>
</div>
<small>34 chart types. Rendered on your Mac.</small>
</div>
<div data-scene-panel="2" hidden="">
<span class="ls-output-label">SHOW HOW IT CONNECTS.</span>
<div class="ls-mini-flow">
<b>Sources</b>
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-down" fill="none" height="18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M12 5v14">
</path>
<path d="m19 12-7 7-7-7">
</path>
</svg>
<b>Definition</b>
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-down" fill="none" height="18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M12 5v14">
</path>
<path d="m19 12-7 7-7-7">
</path>
</svg>
<div>
<b>Table</b>
<b>Chart</b>
</div>
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-down" fill="none" height="18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M12 5v14">
</path>
<path d="m19 12-7 7-7-7">
</path>
</svg>
<b>Review</b>
</div>
<small>20 diagram types. Readable fenced text.</small>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<figcaption class="ls-scene-controls">
<span class="ls-scene-status">
<span data-scene-caption="0">Markdown data becomes an editable table</span>
<span data-scene-caption="1" hidden="">The same numbers become a chart</span>
<span data-scene-caption="2" hidden="">A readable definition becomes a diagram</span>
</span>
<span>
<button aria-label="Next step: One document. Many ways to think." data-scene-next="true" type="button">Next <svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" fill="none" height="14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M5 12h14">
</path>
<path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7">
</path>
</svg>
</button>
<button aria-label="Replay: One document. Many ways to think." data-scene-replay="true" type="button">
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-rotate-ccw" fill="none" height="14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8">
</path>
<path d="M3 3v5h5">
</path>
</svg>
</button>
</span>
</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
